1
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:03,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

2
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[tapping on pen]</b></font>

3
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:44,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did I tell you I own a cat?</b></font>

4
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:47,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were saying?</b></font>

5
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:50,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OE] This cop suddenly
started speaking to me.</b></font>

6
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:52,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then there were two,
and then three of them.</b></font>

7
00:01:53,410 --> 00:01:54,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I thought,
"If they take me in now,</b></font>

8
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:56,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my cat's gonna die."</b></font>

9
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:59,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My place doesn't allow pets.</b></font>

10
00:01:59,580 --> 00:02:00,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you see,</b></font>

11
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm the only one
who knows about it.</b></font>

12
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:05,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] In Morioka City,
Iwate Prefecture,</b></font>

13
00:02:05,750 --> 00:02:07,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in March of 2016,</b></font>

14
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:10,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>two people, a young girl
and her mother,</b></font>

15
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:12,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>were found fatally stabbed
in their own home.</b></font>

16
00:02:13,130 --> 00:02:16,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Morioka Prosecutors Office
indicted Keita Oe,</b></font>

17
00:02:16,390 --> 00:02:18,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who lived near the crime scene.</b></font>

18
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:20,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He was charged
with felony murder and robbery.</b></font>

19
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:23,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The events leading
to his arrest were thus.</b></font>

20
00:02:23,850 --> 00:02:26,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>While being questioned
by three officers on patrol,</b></font>

21
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Keita Oe suddenly fled.</b></font>

22
00:02:28,770 --> 00:02:30,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The patrolmen chased Oe
to his home.</b></font>

23
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once inside,
the officers discovered</b></font>

24
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a knife covered in blood.</b></font>

25
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oe was arrested
in flagrante delicto.</b></font>

26
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:39,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PATROLMAN 1] He's in here!</b></font>

27
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:41,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] After DNA analysis,</b></font>

28
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:43,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the blood
on the blade was revealed</b></font>

29
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:45,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to be a match
to the victim's DNA.</b></font>

30
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[slams]</b></font>

31
00:02:46,370 --> 00:02:49,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oe consistently
denied all charges.</b></font>

32
00:02:49,090 --> 00:02:51,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Asked to explain the knife,
he insisted...</b></font>

33
00:02:52,090 --> 00:02:53,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OE] I just picked it up.</b></font>

34
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wasn't mine.</b></font>

35
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A little hard to believe,
don't you think so?</b></font>

36
00:02:58,050 --> 00:03:00,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He didn't flee questioning
because of his cat,</b></font>

37
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he fled because he was guilty.</b></font>

38
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:03,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] I don't think so.</b></font>

39
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:06,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He had been wrongly detained
by the police before,</b></font>

40
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:09,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when an acquaintance of his
was busted for using drugs.</b></font>

41
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:11,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're saying the police
traumatized him?</b></font>

42
00:03:12,030 --> 00:03:14,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But even so, "I picked it up"?</b></font>

43
00:03:14,490 --> 00:03:16,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who picks up a bloody knife?</b></font>

44
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No one.</b></font>

45
00:03:17,740 --> 00:03:19,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] He claims
he was planning to turn it</b></font>

46
00:03:19,570 --> 00:03:21,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into the police later.</b></font>

47
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Later"?</b></font>

48
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] I know, I know.</b></font>

49
00:03:24,750 --> 00:03:26,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His claims are all hard
to believe.</b></font>

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But when you consider
Oe's background,</b></font>

51
00:03:29,130 --> 00:03:31,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the fact he works
as a live-in employee</b></font>

52
00:03:31,250 --> 00:03:33,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at a non-profit organisation,</b></font>

53
00:03:33,130 --> 00:03:35,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it definitely starts sounding
plausible to me.</b></font>

54
00:03:35,970 --> 00:03:37,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What kind of non-profit?</b></font>

55
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:40,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA]
A shelter for the elderly</b></font>

56
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:41,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who have nowhere else to go.</b></font>

57
00:03:41,850 --> 00:03:44,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They provide support
for their independent living.</b></font>

58
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:46,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oe's job was taking care
of the residents</b></font>

59
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who lived there.</b></font>

60
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:50,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, they didn't pay him
a salary with wages.</b></font>

61
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They only supplied him
with goods</b></font>

62
00:03:51,820 --> 00:03:54,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like groceries, boxed lunches,</b></font>

63
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:57,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and gifts of pocket money
for New Year's sometimes.</b></font>

64
00:03:57,570 --> 00:03:58,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if you could believe it,</b></font>

65
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:01,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they still charged him
50,000 yen a month</b></font>

66
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for rent on his room.</b></font>

67
00:04:02,990 --> 00:04:04,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] Brutal.</b></font>

68
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:06,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently, quite a few
of the residents</b></font>

69
00:04:06,250 --> 00:04:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have prior records.</b></font>

70
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyway, when asked
why he didn't turn in the knife</b></font>

71
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as soon as he found it...</b></font>

72
00:04:11,590 --> 00:04:14,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The rules say
we can't call cop cars.</b></font>

73
00:04:14,130 --> 00:04:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or ambulances either.</b></font>

74
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:18,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They don't want loud sirens
bothering the neighbors.</b></font>

75
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:22,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] That non-profit
sounds pretty suspicious.</b></font>

76
00:04:22,930 --> 00:04:23,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Yeah.</b></font>

77
00:04:24,180 --> 00:04:26,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's extremely close
to being outright illegal.</b></font>

78
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Since the earthquake
relief funds</b></font>

79
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:29,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>started flowing
into this region,</b></font>

80
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:33,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we've seen an increase
in suspiciously managed NPOs.</b></font>

81
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:35,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So it's possible</b></font>

82
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:37,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the murder weapon
was just lying there.</b></font>

83
00:04:38,110 --> 00:04:41,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think there's a good chance
that Oe is innocent.</b></font>

84
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First, we'll investigate</b></font>

85
00:04:44,330 --> 00:04:46,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the organization's activities
and tax filings.</b></font>

86
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:49,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then run background checks
on all the residents.</b></font>

87
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:51,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll focus on getting
more information out of Oe.</b></font>

88
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You handle
the investigation, Shimizu.</b></font>

89
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:56,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] You're dumping
a huge job like that on me</b></font>

90
00:04:56,090 --> 00:04:57,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>out of the blue?</b></font>

91
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door opens]</b></font>

92
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] And could you
take care of his cat?</b></font>

93
00:05:01,010 --> 00:05:02,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] His cat?</b></font>

94
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:05,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The commission on
a public defender case is zilch,</b></font>

95
00:05:05,470 --> 00:05:07,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>no matter how many hours
we bill.</b></font>

96
00:05:07,270 --> 00:05:09,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the public always
assumes they're guilty.</b></font>

97
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, there's no suspended
sentence in murder cases.</b></font>

98
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:14,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he could get
the death penalty.</b></font>

99
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:16,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing to gain
by taking this case.</b></font>

100
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:19,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma, will you
please explain to me</b></font>

101
00:05:19,150 --> 00:05:21,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why you go around
accepting cases like this one?</b></font>

102
00:05:21,860 --> 00:05:23,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's good once in a while.</b></font>

103
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we stuck to easy work,
our skills would dull.</b></font>

104
00:05:26,410 --> 00:05:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] It's more
than once in a while.</b></font>

105
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's more than once in a while!</b></font>

106
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:33,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] You're saying
your thoughts out loud again.</b></font>

107
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takagi laughs]</b></font>

108
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:38,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sounds like Higuruma
hasn't changed a bit, then.</b></font>

109
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:41,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's tough working for
an independent lawyer</b></font>

110
00:05:41,470 --> 00:05:43,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who isn't in it for the money.</b></font>

111
00:05:43,590 --> 00:05:45,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] Yeah, well,
at least I'm not stuck</b></font>

112
00:05:45,550 --> 00:05:47,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>having to run a cafe
on the side like you are.</b></font>

113
00:05:48,430 --> 00:05:49,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, wait a minute.</b></font>

114
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When you say he hasn't changed,</b></font>

115
00:05:50,890 --> 00:05:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you mean Higuruma's
always been like this?</b></font>

116
00:05:52,890 --> 00:05:54,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm? Not really.</b></font>

117
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:57,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think he actually
used to be a lot worse.</b></font>

118
00:05:57,860 --> 00:05:58,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] Huh?</b></font>

119
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAGI]
Back when he was with us,</b></font>

120
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:02,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he was in charge
of a reckless driving case</b></font>

121
00:06:02,990 --> 00:06:04,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that resulted in injury.</b></font>

122
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:06,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Specifically,
it was for drunk driving.</b></font>

123
00:06:07,370 --> 00:06:09,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The defendant was only 19.</b></font>

124
00:06:09,370 --> 00:06:10,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And his co-workers
had coerced him</b></font>

125
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:12,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into doing
both the drinking part</b></font>

126
00:06:12,750 --> 00:06:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the driving part.</b></font>

127
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:17,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, those involved
all aligned their stories,</b></font>

128
00:06:17,670 --> 00:06:19,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and he didn't have the money
for a settlement,</b></font>

129
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:22,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we couldn't get him
a suspended sentence.</b></font>

130
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:25,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[tires screech, crashes]</b></font>

131
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:28,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[CLIENT] You liar!</b></font>

132
00:06:28,470 --> 00:06:30,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing heavily]</b></font>

133
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:33,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You promised me
they would find me innocent!</b></font>

134
00:06:33,770 --> 00:06:36,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You promised to get
him a suspended sentence,</b></font>

135
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not an innocent verdict.</b></font>

136
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:40,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Although you didn't manage
to do either, so there's that.</b></font>

137
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know what
the takeaway from this is?</b></font>

138
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:45,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quit being a criminal defense
lawyer for impossible cases.</b></font>

139
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:47,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trying to save the weak
may be a noble endeavor,</b></font>

140
00:06:48,030 --> 00:06:49,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but there's a limit
to what lawyers like us can do</b></font>

141
00:06:49,950 --> 00:06:52,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without any cooperation
from the courts and prosecutors.</b></font>

142
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:55,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They don't wanna sit
and hear a client's sob story.</b></font>

143
00:06:55,250 --> 00:06:57,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They just wanna
clear their dockets.</b></font>

144
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:59,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's not worth continuing
when your clients resent you.</b></font>

145
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughing]</b></font>

146
00:07:02,010 --> 00:07:03,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] They're at the end
of their rope,</b></font>

147
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>both mentally and financially.</b></font>

148
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't blame them
for lashing out at me.</b></font>

149
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAGI] But, Higuruma,</b></font>

150
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what about your mental state?</b></font>

151
00:07:15,390 --> 00:07:16,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Well, I'm...</b></font>

152
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:20,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ percussion music playing]</b></font>

153
00:07:27,110 --> 00:07:28,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[inaudible]</b></font>

154
00:07:35,450 --> 00:07:37,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[snoring softly]</b></font>

155
00:07:38,790 --> 00:07:41,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JUDGE] We the People,
find the defendant...</b></font>

156
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>innocent.</b></font>

157
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:45,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hushed chatter]</b></font>

158
00:07:45,670 --> 00:07:47,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

159
00:07:48,550 --> 00:07:50,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We actually won this case?</b></font>

160
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Not yet.</b></font>

161
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'll appeal right away.</b></font>

162
00:08:02,690 --> 00:08:04,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The prosecution is appealing...</b></font>

163
00:08:05,530 --> 00:08:06,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[camera clicks]</b></font>

164
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHIMIZU] After the police
searched your room</b></font>

165
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:15,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for stolen items,</b></font>

166
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:17,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>nothing was found there.</b></font>

167
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:19,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And in the same
non-profit residence,</b></font>

168
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>another person went missing</b></font>

169
00:08:21,130 --> 00:08:22,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>right after
the crime was committed.</b></font>

170
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:25,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Luckily, you were caught
on the security feed</b></font>

171
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:26,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a convenience store.</b></font>

172
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:28,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That and the condition
of the corpses proved</b></font>

173
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you couldn't have been
at the scene of the murders.</b></font>

174
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] Boy,
it's a good thing</b></font>

175
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you don't know
how to cook for yourself.</b></font>

176
00:08:34,970 --> 00:08:36,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma, sir.</b></font>

177
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanna thank you
for everything.</b></font>

178
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no need
to call me "sir."</b></font>

179
00:08:41,310 --> 00:08:42,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're not in the clear yet.</b></font>

180
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's still the appeal.</b></font>

181
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:47,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's not what I mean.</b></font>

182
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:51,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're the only one
who believed me.</b></font>

183
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:52,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

184
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:04,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] While
defense lawyers have to work</b></font>

185
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:06,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with limited budgets
and manpower,</b></font>

186
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:08,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>prosecutors can use
taxpayer money</b></font>

187
00:09:08,420 --> 00:09:11,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to pour on the lawyers
and dig up the evidence.</b></font>

188
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:12,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's fine.</b></font>

189
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's how the system works.</b></font>

190
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However,</b></font>

191
00:09:15,970 --> 00:09:17,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the prosecutors didn't submit</b></font>

192
00:09:17,430 --> 00:09:19,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>any new evidence
during the second trial.</b></font>

193
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The judge accepted
their absurd claim</b></font>

194
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:25,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that there was no reason
to consider the missing person</b></font>

195
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as a suspect.</b></font>

196
00:09:27,780 --> 00:09:29,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So they overturned the verdict.</b></font>

197
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:32,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The highest court
is always the bottleneck</b></font>

198
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for a third trial.</b></font>

199
00:09:33,820 --> 00:09:36,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Most final appeals
are turned away at the door.</b></font>

200
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:39,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's challenging to even
get a proper trial there.</b></font>

201
00:09:40,500 --> 00:09:43,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This trial was destined
for a guilty verdict</b></font>

202
00:09:43,460 --> 00:09:44,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the start.</b></font>

203
00:09:51,590 --> 00:09:53,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why are you...</b></font>

204
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:56,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>looking at me that way?</b></font>

205
00:09:59,770 --> 00:10:00,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKAGI] But, Higuruma...</b></font>

206
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>what about your mental state?</b></font>

207
00:10:03,850 --> 00:10:05,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

208
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Well,
I'm not trying to promote</b></font>

209
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:09,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the ideals of saving the weak.</b></font>

210
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just always
gone against my nature</b></font>

211
00:10:11,190 --> 00:10:13,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to leave things alone
when I feel like they're wrong.</b></font>

212
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've just never been able
to fix that habit.</b></font>

213
00:10:17,580 --> 00:10:19,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The goddess of justice
blinds her sight</b></font>

214
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:21,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to maintain fairness
under the law.</b></font>

215
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And people turn a blind eye
to all kinds of things</b></font>

216
00:10:24,370 --> 00:10:25,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to protect themselves.</b></font>

217
00:10:27,290 --> 00:10:29,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I don't wanna brush away
the hands of people</b></font>

218
00:10:29,460 --> 00:10:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who cling to me for help.</b></font>

219
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:37,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The least I can do
is keep my eyes open.</b></font>

220
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:42,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hushed chatter]</b></font>

221
00:10:42,140 --> 00:10:44,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[APPELLATE JUDGE] If there are
any objections to today's trial,</b></font>

222
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:48,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>submit your final appeal
in writing within 15 days,</b></font>

223
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which includes today.</b></font>

224
00:10:50,230 --> 00:10:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[hushed chatter continues]</b></font>

225
00:10:53,070 --> 00:10:54,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Higuruma sighs]</b></font>

226
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:59,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gavel banging]</b></font>

227
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma, what are you doing?</b></font>

228
00:11:06,370 --> 00:11:08,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Everyone come back!</b></font>

229
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:09,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Shimizu gasps]</b></font>

230
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:14,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're having a retrial.</b></font>

231
00:11:18,010 --> 00:11:19,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[REMI] Higuruma's in...
-[AMAI] Higuruma's in...</b></font>

232
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-...Shinjuku.
-...Ikebukuro.</b></font>

233
00:11:22,270 --> 00:11:24,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Got it?
-Shinjuku?</b></font>

234
00:11:24,930 --> 00:11:27,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I hope Itadori's
headed there, too.</b></font>

235
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ikebukuro, huh?</b></font>

236
00:11:28,770 --> 00:11:30,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder if Fushiguro's there.</b></font>

237
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:36,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs] Isn't she
running a little late?</b></font>

238
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:39,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That girl better
get here soon or else.</b></font>

239
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if she doesn't have
my neck sucker with her,</b></font>

240
00:11:41,490 --> 00:11:43,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she'd better not come at all.</b></font>

241
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:48,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[slaps]
-[man groans]</b></font>

242
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:52,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[slaps]
-Ow. What's your problem?</b></font>

243
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:55,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] No, no, no, no!</b></font>

244
00:11:55,420 --> 00:11:56,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We ask the questions!</b></font>

245
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:59,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you doing
around here, huh?</b></font>

246
00:11:59,510 --> 00:12:01,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is getting old.</b></font>

247
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:03,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

248
00:12:03,100 --> 00:12:04,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI]
Why are you keeping quiet?</b></font>

249
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:07,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're better off
laughing with us.</b></font>

250
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:09,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 1]
What? You gonna hit me?</b></font>

251
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[grunts]
-[students laughing]</b></font>

252
00:12:10,980 --> 00:12:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Oh, dear.
What did I tell you?</b></font>

253
00:12:14,110 --> 00:12:16,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not that I actually told you.</b></font>

254
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:18,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why can't you understand?</b></font>

255
00:12:18,410 --> 00:12:19,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you an idiot?</b></font>

256
00:12:19,860 --> 00:12:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These guys aren't
that smart or athletic,</b></font>

257
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:24,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but they're brimming with pride.</b></font>

258
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:27,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All you have to do
is just match their attitude</b></font>

259
00:12:27,210 --> 00:12:28,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and joke around with them,</b></font>

260
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:31,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so you don't hurt
that ego of theirs.</b></font>

261
00:12:31,210 --> 00:12:34,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then you won't get targeted
by anyone else, either.</b></font>

262
00:12:34,210 --> 00:12:36,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you might even have
a good time now and then.</b></font>

263
00:12:36,460 --> 00:12:37,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[girls giggling]</b></font>

264
00:12:37,380 --> 00:12:39,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Knock it off.
-Hmm?</b></font>

265
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:41,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs]</b></font>

266
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:43,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI]
Here comes another idiot.</b></font>

267
00:12:43,850 --> 00:12:46,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 1] Is that uniform
from West Middle?</b></font>

268
00:12:46,270 --> 00:12:48,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]
You're in middle school?</b></font>

269
00:12:48,060 --> 00:12:50,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 2] You need
to learn some respect!</b></font>

270
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're gonna teach you a lesson!</b></font>

271
00:12:52,190 --> 00:12:53,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

272
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Down you go!</b></font>

273
00:12:55,150 --> 00:12:56,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

274
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:58,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

275
00:13:01,490 --> 00:13:02,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STUDENT 1] Huh?</b></font>

276
00:13:05,950 --> 00:13:07,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[metal rod scraping]</b></font>

277
00:13:09,870 --> 00:13:12,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really shouldn't be
so violent!</b></font>

278
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:13,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

279
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:16,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

280
00:13:16,460 --> 00:13:20,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[groans]
-[grunts]</b></font>

281
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? [groaning]</b></font>

282
00:13:23,890 --> 00:13:25,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

283
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:27,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[students coughing and groaning]</b></font>

284
00:13:29,180 --> 00:13:30,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] And you?</b></font>

285
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[heart thumping]</b></font>

286
00:13:33,650 --> 00:13:35,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Y-you... you mean me?</b></font>

287
00:13:36,730 --> 00:13:37,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Hey.</b></font>

288
00:13:38,030 --> 00:13:39,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] What now?</b></font>

289
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] You aren't planning
to go through Ikebukuro</b></font>

290
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to reach Shinjuku, are you?</b></font>

291
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:44,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That area's rich
with supplies.</b></font>

292
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:46,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're more likely
to encounter other players.</b></font>

293
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:50,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] There are two reasons
for going this way.</b></font>

294
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:52,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The route is easy to follow,</b></font>

295
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:55,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I happen
to have a base nearby.</b></font>

296
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:58,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just dying
to take a shower.</b></font>

297
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:01,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't had a chance
to rest since yesterday.</b></font>

298
00:14:04,220 --> 00:14:07,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Higuruma uses
this theater as his base.</b></font>

299
00:14:07,180 --> 00:14:08,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Assuming he hasn't moved,
that is.</b></font>

300
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:10,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah, cool.</b></font>

301
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've been a big help, man.</b></font>

302
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:12,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

303
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:16,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, wait a minute.
Hold up, don't go.</b></font>

304
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Hmm? What is it?</b></font>

305
00:14:17,610 --> 00:14:19,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI]
Uh, you're seriously going in?</b></font>

306
00:14:19,570 --> 00:14:21,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Well, I'd have preferred
to go in with my friend,</b></font>

307
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:22,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I'm in a hurry.</b></font>

308
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:26,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never actually met
Higuruma myself.</b></font>

309
00:14:26,410 --> 00:14:29,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I once saw him beat Haba
to a pulp right in front of me.</b></font>

310
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I'll totally be okay.</b></font>

311
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I beat propeller head, too.</b></font>

312
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Which means I'll
at least be able to run away.</b></font>

313
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:35,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Amai hesitates]</b></font>

314
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] See you later.</b></font>

315
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[AMAI] Uh...</b></font>

316
00:14:40,050 --> 00:14:42,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[heart thumping]
- Tell him.</b></font>

317
00:14:42,050 --> 00:14:44,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, man, tell him!</b></font>

318
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should stop doing this.</b></font>

319
00:14:52,600 --> 00:14:53,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry...</b></font>

320
00:14:54,230 --> 00:14:55,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door creaks]</b></font>

321
00:14:55,270 --> 00:14:56,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>...Itadori.</b></font>

322
00:14:58,940 --> 00:15:01,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's about time, Higuruma.</b></font>

323
00:15:01,190 --> 00:15:02,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

324
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:05,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, I guess we were
both expecting to see him.</b></font>

325
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm Reggie.</b></font>

326
00:15:07,410 --> 00:15:09,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And she deceived you.</b></font>

327
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:14,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't give me that look.</b></font>

328
00:15:14,620 --> 00:15:16,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't scare me for a second.</b></font>

329
00:15:16,830 --> 00:15:19,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-And just so you know, Reggie--
-[MEGUMI] Quiet!</b></font>

330
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[snarls]</b></font>

331
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles excitedly]</b></font>

332
00:15:25,970 --> 00:15:27,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm wasting my time here.</b></font>

333
00:15:38,770 --> 00:15:40,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Who's there?</b></font>

334
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:42,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you doing here?</b></font>

335
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I could ask you that.</b></font>

336
00:15:46,110 --> 00:15:47,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ah.</b></font>

337
00:15:48,070 --> 00:15:49,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ever have the chance
to take a bath</b></font>

338
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:51,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>while still fully clothed?</b></font>

339
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:52,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Never.</b></font>

340
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:56,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Surprisingly, it feels better
than I expected it would.</b></font>

341
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:00,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know...</b></font>

342
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:04,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>back when I was
in elementary school,</b></font>

343
00:16:04,090 --> 00:16:07,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I loved our safety classes
on swimming in clothes.</b></font>

344
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:11,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So many things have stopped
mattering to me lately.</b></font>

345
00:16:11,970 --> 00:16:13,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I've been challenging myself</b></font>

346
00:16:13,310 --> 00:16:16,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to try things I assumed
I shouldn't be doing.</b></font>

347
00:16:16,430 --> 00:16:18,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've basically
gone off the rails</b></font>

348
00:16:18,190 --> 00:16:19,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after hitting my mid-30s.</b></font>

349
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:21,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Funny, huh?</b></font>

350
00:16:21,690 --> 00:16:23,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess it's kind of amusing.</b></font>

351
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:25,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're Higuruma, right?</b></font>

352
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:27,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In the flesh.</b></font>

353
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm here to talk.</b></font>

354
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:31,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Hold on.
Wait, wait, wait, wait.</b></font>

355
00:16:32,330 --> 00:16:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I happen to be a lawyer.</b></font>

356
00:16:33,990 --> 00:16:37,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For 30 minutes,
I charged 5,000 yen to consult.</b></font>

357
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So either pay up or shut up.</b></font>

358
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:40,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

359
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:41,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

360
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:42,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just kidding.</b></font>

361
00:16:42,670 --> 00:16:44,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to see
what it feels like</b></font>

362
00:16:44,130 --> 00:16:46,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to be a cutthroat lawyer.
[laughs]</b></font>

363
00:16:47,170 --> 00:16:48,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I see.</b></font>

364
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:50,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's this guy doing?</b></font>

365
00:16:51,470 --> 00:16:53,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You still have a hundred points,
don't you?</b></font>

366
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:57,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's not a past sorcerer
who's been incarnated.</b></font>

367
00:16:57,100 --> 00:17:00,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's a modern sorcerer
whose technique was activated.</b></font>

368
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:02,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We can talk it out.
There's room for negotiation.</b></font>

369
00:17:03,230 --> 00:17:05,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Okay,
you passed the test</b></font>

370
00:17:05,070 --> 00:17:06,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-with flying colors.
-[MEGUMI] Huh?</b></font>

371
00:17:06,780 --> 00:17:09,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] You've got more
than enough, I can tell.</b></font>

372
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:11,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's quite the shikigami
you have there.</b></font>

373
00:17:11,490 --> 00:17:13,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet you're strong.</b></font>

374
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you were weak,
I'd just kill you</b></font>

375
00:17:14,910 --> 00:17:16,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as another average mark.</b></font>

376
00:17:16,370 --> 00:17:17,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you're good.</b></font>

377
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:18,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's work together.</b></font>

378
00:17:18,870 --> 00:17:21,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REMI] What gives?
I didn't agree to this!</b></font>

379
00:17:23,130 --> 00:17:24,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] What are you proposing?</b></font>

380
00:17:25,090 --> 00:17:27,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] How much
do you actually know so far</b></font>

381
00:17:27,170 --> 00:17:28,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about this Culling Game?</b></font>

382
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] It's a ritual.</b></font>

383
00:17:30,930 --> 00:17:32,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It uses the cursed energy</b></font>

384
00:17:32,090 --> 00:17:33,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the players
inside the barriers</b></font>

385
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:36,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to ferry the people of Japan
to the other side.</b></font>

386
00:17:36,760 --> 00:17:39,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And then changes them
into something inhuman.</b></font>

387
00:17:39,930 --> 00:17:42,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess I should stay quiet
about Tengen.</b></font>

388
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Really?</b></font>

389
00:17:44,150 --> 00:17:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Do you know Kenjaku, then?
-[gasps]</b></font>

390
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:49,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I knew there had
to be at least one sorcerer</b></font>

391
00:17:49,190 --> 00:17:51,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>connected to Kenjaku
in this game.</b></font>

392
00:17:52,530 --> 00:17:53,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Uh, so,</b></font>

393
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:55,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to be frank,</b></font>

394
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:56,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we need your help.</b></font>

395
00:17:57,370 --> 00:17:59,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We wanna stop
the Culling Game.</b></font>

396
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:00,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, time out.</b></font>

397
00:18:00,910 --> 00:18:02,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When I say stop the game,</b></font>

398
00:18:02,370 --> 00:18:04,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean stop
the obligated killing.</b></font>

399
00:18:04,670 --> 00:18:06,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we could use
your hundred points,</b></font>

400
00:18:06,540 --> 00:18:08,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'd be able
to add a new rule to the game.</b></font>

401
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:11,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Permit me
to be frank as well.</b></font>

402
00:18:12,010 --> 00:18:13,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I refuse.</b></font>

403
00:18:15,430 --> 00:18:17,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Is that another joke?</b></font>

404
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:19,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. I just sense huge potential</b></font>

405
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:21,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in letting the Culling Game
continue as is.</b></font>

406
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:24,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sometimes the law is powerless.</b></font>

407
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:27,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However, think about the rules
of this Culling Game.</b></font>

408
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:29,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If the power
I've been granted is real,</b></font>

409
00:18:29,900 --> 00:18:31,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then those rules must be, too.</b></font>

410
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:33,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] I think all your talk</b></font>

411
00:18:33,610 --> 00:18:36,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about players' cursed energy
being used inside the barriers,</b></font>

412
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:38,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's probably just a bluff.</b></font>

413
00:18:38,530 --> 00:18:39,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] A bluff?</b></font>

414
00:18:39,990 --> 00:18:41,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] Well, less of a bluff,</b></font>

415
00:18:41,410 --> 00:18:44,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and more like you're
describing Plan B or C.</b></font>

416
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:46,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Here's three reasons why.</b></font>

417
00:18:46,630 --> 00:18:48,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The number of players,</b></font>

418
00:18:48,130 --> 00:18:50,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the strength gap
between players,</b></font>

419
00:18:50,130 --> 00:18:51,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the barriers' rules.</b></font>

420
00:18:52,170 --> 00:18:54,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If roughly 1,000 people
were equally split up</b></font>

421
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:56,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>between the 10 colonies,</b></font>

422
00:18:56,390 --> 00:18:59,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that would come out
to 100 people per colony.</b></font>

423
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:02,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However,
among the players are sorcerers</b></font>

424
00:19:02,810 --> 00:19:04,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like Kashimo or Higuruma,</b></font>

425
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who are much stronger
than the rest.</b></font>

426
00:19:06,940 --> 00:19:08,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those two alone
have already culled</b></font>

427
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:10,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>60 sorcerers between them.</b></font>

428
00:19:10,730 --> 00:19:13,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I bet you, there's
a sorcerer just like them</b></font>

429
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in each of the other colonies.</b></font>

430
00:19:15,070 --> 00:19:17,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So then, the weak
are weeded out early on.</b></font>

431
00:19:17,530 --> 00:19:20,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that mean the Culling Game
ends as a stalemate?</b></font>

432
00:19:20,530 --> 00:19:22,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's confirmed my suspicions.</b></font>

433
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:24,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The colony's been too quiet.</b></font>

434
00:19:25,670 --> 00:19:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It already has.</b></font>

435
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:29,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, at least it has
here in Tokyo Number One.</b></font>

436
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:32,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>On top of that,
there's the teleportation,</b></font>

437
00:19:32,050 --> 00:19:33,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when people enter the colonies.</b></font>

438
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:36,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It serves to spread out players
as they enter the game.</b></font>

439
00:19:36,220 --> 00:19:38,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But its main goal
is likely to encourage</b></font>

440
00:19:38,220 --> 00:19:40,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>an early second awakening
of modern sorcerers.</b></font>

441
00:19:40,930 --> 00:19:43,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are some who die
during the teleportation, too.</b></font>

442
00:19:43,850 --> 00:19:45,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, if he was really trying</b></font>

443
00:19:45,230 --> 00:19:46,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to use the players'
cursed energy,</b></font>

444
00:19:46,850 --> 00:19:49,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then he would probably want
the greatest number of sorcerers</b></font>

445
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:51,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to fight
for the longest time possible.</b></font>

446
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:54,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] What if people who
broke the rules were punished,</b></font>

447
00:19:54,110 --> 00:19:55,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not with the need
of indictments,</b></font>

448
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:58,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>prosecutions or arguments
at trials,</b></font>

449
00:19:58,070 --> 00:19:59,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but by pure physics instead?</b></font>

450
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wouldn't that be wonderful?</b></font>

451
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:04,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll grant you, there's issues
with the current rules,</b></font>

452
00:20:04,410 --> 00:20:05,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I wanna watch
over the system</b></font>

453
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>serving as a basis
for this game.</b></font>

454
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:10,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll ruin everything
if it ends too soon.</b></font>

455
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd especially love
to witness at least once,</b></font>

456
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:14,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the stripping of a technique</b></font>

457
00:20:14,510 --> 00:20:16,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>mentioned in rules two
and eight.</b></font>

458
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:17,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it's better for the rules</b></font>

459
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if being stripped
means death, too.</b></font>

460
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:22,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Culling Game itself
is considered a ritual.</b></font>

461
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:24,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we take too long,</b></font>

462
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:26,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>every person in this nation
will die.</b></font>

463
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:27,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's not true.</b></font>

464
00:20:28,020 --> 00:20:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Culling Game insists
on its own ongoing longevity.</b></font>

465
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:32,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I don't really
get that part either!</b></font>

466
00:20:35,690 --> 00:20:37,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll rephrase it, then.</b></font>

467
00:20:38,280 --> 00:20:41,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let me use your 100 points,
Higuruma!</b></font>

468
00:20:42,580 --> 00:20:44,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA]
Have you ever killed someone</b></font>

469
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:46,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who really ticked you off?</b></font>

470
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:48,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ energetic rock music playing]</b></font>

471
00:20:49,710 --> 00:20:51,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Feels better than I expected.</b></font>

472
00:20:52,420 --> 00:20:54,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A helluva lot better.</b></font>

473
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:56,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] A shikigami?</b></font>

474
00:20:56,670 --> 00:20:58,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma has a hundred points.</b></font>

475
00:20:58,590 --> 00:21:00,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He might have killed
20 sorcerers already.</b></font>

476
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:03,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't just recklessly jump in.</b></font>

477
00:21:03,430 --> 00:21:04,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll go on defense.</b></font>

478
00:21:05,140 --> 00:21:07,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'll be ready
to respond to any attack.</b></font>

479
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:12,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Domain Expansion.</b></font>

480
00:21:12,730 --> 00:21:14,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Deadly Sentencing.</b></font>

481
00:21:14,360 --> 00:21:16,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gavel banging]</b></font>

482
00:21:26,870 --> 00:21:28,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE] The idea
of a rule not hindering</b></font>

483
00:21:28,960 --> 00:21:30,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the continuation of the game,</b></font>

484
00:21:30,540 --> 00:21:32,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's just a cover
for the real plan.</b></font>

485
00:21:32,750 --> 00:21:34,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mark my words.</b></font>

486
00:21:34,420 --> 00:21:36,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When only the strong remain,</b></font>

487
00:21:36,210 --> 00:21:39,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kenjaku is going to drop a bomb
on this competition.</b></font>

488
00:21:39,510 --> 00:21:43,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the Culling Game
will fulfill its purpose.</b></font>

489
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:50,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[explosion]</b></font>

490
00:22:10,330 --> 00:22:12,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

491
00:23:40,630 --> 00:23:42,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Now,
make your argument.</b></font>

492
00:23:42,550 --> 00:23:43,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
What if I'm judged guilty?</b></font>

493
00:23:43,760 --> 00:23:44,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Judgeman,
please begin.</b></font>

494
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] You mean I can lie?</b></font>

495
00:23:46,340 --> 00:23:47,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] You get one chance
to make a statement.</b></font>

496
00:23:47,470 --> 00:23:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI]
I can't control cursed energy!</b></font>

497
00:23:48,800 --> 00:23:50,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] How can he
hold his own against me</b></font>

498
00:23:50,390 --> 00:23:51,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without cursed energy?</b></font>

499
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I want a retrial!</b></font>

500
00:23:52,930 --> 00:23:53,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One more time!</b></font>

